
flowchart TD
    Start([Start]) --> ReaderSelect[Reader selects a book copy]
    ReaderSelect --> Submit[Reader submits reservation request]
    Submit --> UI[ReservationUI receives request]
    UI --> Validate[ReservationService validates request]
    Validate --> CheckCopies{Are any book copies available?}

    CheckCopies -- No --> NoCopies[Display: No copies available]
    NoCopies --> End1([End - SC-02])

    CheckCopies -- Yes --> CheckSelected{Is the selected copy available?}

    CheckSelected -- No --> AlreadyReserved[Display: Selected copy is already reserved]
    AlreadyReserved --> End2([End - SC-03])

    CheckSelected -- Yes --> CreateReservation[Create Reservation record]
    CreateReservation --> Fork((Fork))

    Fork --> UpdateCopy[Update BookCopy status to reserved]
    Fork --> SendNotification[NotificationService sends confirmation to Reader]

    UpdateCopy --> Join((Join))
    SendNotification --> Join

    Join --> ShowConfirmation[ReservationUI displays confirmation]
    ShowConfirmation --> End3([End - SC-01])
